Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.42,0:00:03.90,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Yes, he's done it!{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N是的 他做到了！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.30,0:00:08.60,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Carlos Alcaraz is the Nitto ATP Finals champion.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N阿尔卡拉斯成为年终总决赛冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.30,0:00:13.80,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Historic moment.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N历史性的一刻
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.05,0:00:16.32,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}北京时间{\fs78}11{\fs68}月{\fs78}23{\fs68}日凌晨
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.32,0:00:18.14,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fs78}ATP{\fs68}年终总决赛决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.14,0:00:19.53,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}阿尔卡拉斯{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}2{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.53,0:00:22.63,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fs78}7{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68}击败兹维列夫 首次捧杯
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.63,0:00:23.66,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fs78}5{\fs68}场全胜
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.66,0:00:26.89,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}这座冠军从小组赛开始讲起
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.05,0:00:29.21,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}首战蒂亚福
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.21,0:00:31.80,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}阿尔卡拉斯打出两个{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}2{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.80,0:00:33.85,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}一场只丢{\fs78}4{\fs68}局的小组赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.85,0:00:36.18,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}为这一周开了个好头
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.84,0:00:44.16,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}That will do it.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N比赛就此结束
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.16,0:00:46.35,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}A near-perfect display{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N近乎完美的表现
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.35,0:00:48.52,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}from Carlos Alcaraz.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N来自卡洛斯 阿尔卡拉斯
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.44,0:00:52.00,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Simply sensational, every department.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N各个环节 都出色极了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.15,0:00:58.49,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}第二场遇到梅德韦德夫
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.49,0:01:01.80,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}阿尔卡拉斯因左腿问题申请医疗暂停
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.80,0:01:03.98,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}仍以{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}2{\fs68} {\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}4{\fs68}取胜
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.98,0:01:06.06,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}两场都没丢盘
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.54,0:01:14.24,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Alcaraz makes it two out of two{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N阿尔卡拉斯取得两战全胜
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.24,0:01:16.12,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}this week here in Turin.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N就在本周的都灵
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.12,0:01:18.42,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Even with the medical timeout,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N尽管中途申请了医疗暂停
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.42,0:01:21.00,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}still a very comfortable scoreline.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N最终比分依然相当轻松
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.15,0:01:27.07,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}小组赛最后一场 对阵科博利
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.07,0:01:30.13,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}他{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}4{\fs68} {\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}1{\fs68}过关 三战全胜
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.13,0:01:32.84,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}一盘未丢 进入半决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.00,0:01:41.10,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Another outrageously good performance{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N又是一场好得惊人的表现
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.10,0:01:43.00,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}from Carlos Alcaraz.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N来自卡洛斯 阿尔卡拉斯
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.05,0:01:45.45,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Nothing Cobolli could do.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N科博利无能为力
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.15,0:01:54.61,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}半决赛才是真正的苦战
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.61,0:01:56.27,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}谢尔顿先拿{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}3{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.27,0:01:57.54,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}第二盘{\fs78}4{\fs68}比{\fs78}3{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.54,0:02:00.96,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}阿尔卡拉斯在对手发球局等到机会
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.39,0:02:04.20,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Some point.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这一分真精彩
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.45,0:02:19.10,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Yeah, there is.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N是的 来了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.55,0:02:21.95,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}First break of the day.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N他今天的第一次破发
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.15,0:02:25.17,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}底线相持后 谢尔顿回球出界
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.17,0:02:27.63,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}阿尔卡拉斯第一次破掉他的发球局
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.63,0:02:30.13,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fs78}5{\fs68}比{\fs78}3{\fs68} 随后{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}3{\fs68}扳平
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.13,0:02:33.42,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}决胜盘打到{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68} 最后这轮小分
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.42,0:02:35.66,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}他只让对手拿到一分
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.34,0:02:40.24,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Well in control now, with a change of ends.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N换边之后 他已经掌控局面
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.40,0:02:45.05,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}What a way to seal it!{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N以这样的方式锁定胜利！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.05,0:02:47.42,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Carlos Alcaraz survives.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N阿尔卡拉斯挺过了这场考验
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.42,0:02:49.20,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}He's back in the final in Turin.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N他再次闯进都灵的决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.15,0:02:52.77,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}决赛对兹维列夫 首盘
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.77,0:02:55.95,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}阿尔卡拉斯{\fs78}3{\fs68}次拿下对手的发球局
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.95,0:02:58.05,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}这是{\fs78}4{\fs68}比{\fs78}2{\fs68}时的又一次机会
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.05,0:03:00.76,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}拿下就能把差距拉到{\fs78}5{\fs68}比{\fs78}2{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.42,0:03:20.80,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Once more, he's got a nice cushion.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N他再次拉开了领先差距
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.75,0:03:25.03,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}首盘{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}2{\fs68} 第二盘又领先{\fs78}4{\fs68}比{\fs78}2{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.03,0:03:27.61,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}到了{\fs78}4{\fs68}比{\fs78}3{\fs68} 阿尔卡拉斯发球
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.61,0:03:30.32,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}兹维列夫拿到了一次机会
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.28,0:03:35.57,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}It's too good that time. Beautiful volley.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这次太漂亮了 精彩的截击
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.37,0:03:42.55,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And he breaks!{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N他破发了！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.58,0:03:46.15,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And it is game on!{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N比赛又有悬念了！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.30,0:03:49.07,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fs78}4{\fs68}比{\fs78}4{\fs68} 兹维列夫又保住发球局
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.07,0:03:50.61,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}追到{\fs78}5{\fs68}比{\fs78}4{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.61,0:03:52.42,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}比赛最终打到{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.42,0:03:55.25,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}小分{\fs78}3{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68} {\fs78}3{\fs68}个连续盘点
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.25,0:03:58.87,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}兹维列夫再拿一分 就能扳平盘数
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.45,0:04:13.95,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Didn't get there that time.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这次没能赶上
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.55,0:04:21.05,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}That's two gone.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N两个盘点都没了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.46,0:04:40.57,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}第三个盘点
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.57,0:04:43.56,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}兹维列夫在底线相持中回球出界
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.56,0:04:44.74,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.74,0:04:47.16,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}阿尔卡拉斯连续救回{\fs78}3{\fs68}个机会
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.16,0:04:49.49,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}随后又错过第一个冠军点
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.49,0:04:52.20,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fs78}8{\fs68}比{\fs78}7{\fs68} 第二次机会来到
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.37,0:04:55.45,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Oh, he's used that drop shot an awful lot,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N他用了很多次放小球
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.45,0:04:56.77,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}hasn't he? In the last few minutes.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N对吧？就在最近这几分钟
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.33,0:05:20.81,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Yes, he's done it!{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N是的 他做到了！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.21,0:05:25.51,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Carlos Alcaraz is the Nitto ATP Finals champion.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N阿尔卡拉斯成为年终总决赛冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.21,0:05:30.71,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Historic moment.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N历史性的一刻
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.06,0:05:46.21,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Time to celebrate.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N尽情庆祝吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.86,0:05:52.29,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}最后一拍 反拍制胜
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.29,0:05:54.57,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}阿尔卡拉斯仰面倒在球场上
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.57,0:05:57.00,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}起身后走向团队拥抱
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.00,0:05:58.38,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}去年决赛失利
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.38,0:06:01.31,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}今年这座奖杯终于属于他
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.56,0:06:33.63,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fs78}5{\fs68}场全胜 赛季第六冠 生涯第{\fs78}30{\fs68}冠
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.63,0:06:36.46,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}这一周 你最记得半决赛的逆转
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.46,0:06:39.21,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}还是决赛救回{\fs78}3{\fs68}个盘点？
